      "created_at": "2013-04-13T14:12:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They have similar uniforms, but they are not the same. The colors are all reversed. I would say that considering them possible twins is way more plausable than being the same person. You can put their cards together (like pride and predujuce). I would think they are standing on the feild next to eachother.</p>\n<p>Also, has it been confirmed that the guy in \"No Executions\" bounty is indeed Truth? As I type this, I JUST noticed the rising sun emblem on the \"No Executions\" bounty. Thats pretty clear to me now haha.</p>\n<p>I can not speak to Truth being plot relevant or not, but he is totally one target I wouldnt mind not seeing in game <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>",
