      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-13T14:34:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Granted I don't know if they are in fact the same person or not. Though their initial look they didn't look anything alike. I'm not entirely sure why their look was changed, but unless their back story has been changed I don't see them being the same person.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mechanically why they take eachother out of the game is because it is Truth or Dare, unlike everything else which is Sweat, Blood, and Tears; Assualt and Battery; Hammer and Anvil; and of course the Four Seasons Hotel. So mechanically I understand it, themeatically i'm not entirely positive about it.</p>",
