      "created_at": "2013-04-13T15:55:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Drakossozh\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Drakossozh:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I never noticed this, but now that you mention it… Perhaps they are the same person, but different personalities? As in, a split-pesonality, though the current medical term now escapes me… Either way, it could be the same person, but whose powers manifest with different personalities?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>(it's called Dissociative Identity Disorder or DID for short. I'm glad you didn't call it schizophrenia, as that's a diffrent thing entirely)</p>\n<p>Of course, they could be twins, and the fact that they kill each other is part of the game balance. Or maybe they don't want to steal each other's thunder, or something. It could be entirly possible they could be the ones who help power Dawn, which is why they go to the trash; they help her charge up more directly. They do seem to have light based powers…</p>",
